                "text": "Last week, RFK Jr. told a bold-faced lie that there were \u201cno cuts to Medicaid\u201d in Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill.\n\nNow, hundreds of thousands of Massachusetts residents are preparing to lose their health care because of Trump and Republicans\u2019 cruel cuts to Medicaid. All to pay for tax cuts for billionaires. The Make America Sick Agenda.",
