                "text": "Your Big Ugly Bill imposed the largest cuts to health care in U.S. history, including over $900 billion in Medicaid cuts. Rural hospitals are already shutting down and reducing services as a result.\n\nTell Trump to stop hiding behind Truth Social and sit down with Democrats.",
