                "text": "325,000 Massachusetts residents could lose their health care under Trump\u2019s Medicaid cuts.\n\nYet Republicans are in a witness protection program, refusing to even show up to fix this crisis. Health is the first wealth, and Republicans want the American people to go broke. https://t.co/2lqzYIkUgF",
