                "retweet_count": 74,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just joined @SenJeffMerkley to lay out the stakes of Trump\u2019s health care crisis:\n\n- Over 320,000 Massachusetts residents could lose health coverage\n- $2 billion in Medicaid funding gone\n- 19,000 health care jobs erased\n- Premiums up $1,000/mo for some families\n\nHealth care is a right, but it\u2019s quickly becoming a casualty of MAGA cruelty",
